society|Broad social community and organized interest association are separated, with uncountable/countable guidance. Libraries and history group examples translate faithfully without suggesting the association represents all society.
weekly|Source adjective evidence retained; market occurs each week and its location is preserved in Vietnamese. Note explicitly avoids labelling the adverb use as the same proposed POS.
celebration|Happy commemorative event rather than any gathering is the boundary. Library anniversary example is original; small size does not become a lexical requirement and countability guidance is specific.
fossil|Definition includes traces as well as remains, checked against Natural History Museum explanation. Leaf outline avoids animal-only restriction; Vietnamese does not invent species, age or fossil formation mechanism.
into|Spatial entry and transformation result are distinct source ordinals. Folded map location and conversion of empty shop translate directly; in versus into contrast is relevant grammar rather than a universal verb rule.
